=== Key Points ===
- Thread.spawn(|| {}) creates raw OS threads
- ThreadPool.spawn(|| {}) uses thread pool (needs using ThreadPool)
- handle.join() waits for completion
- handle.detach() runs in background
- Channels enable message passing
- No data races - compiler enforces safety
- No function coloring - threads are first-class
